  "evidence": "TEXT_E: eliminate the deficit and run a surplus; no rises in VAT/Income Tax/NI while raising the Personal Allowance to £12,500; invest £100bn in infrastructure (HS2/HS3, roads, broadband); increase NHS spending every year with at least £8bn extra by 2020 and a 7‑day NHS; control immigration with a net‑migration target in the tens of thousands, exit checks, illegal‑working clampdowns, and English‑language requirements; create 2m more jobs and 3m apprenticeships; build 200,000 Starter Homes and extend Help to Buy. TEXT_D: leave the EU to end free movement and adopt a points system with a 5‑year moratorium on unskilled immigration; £12bn extra for the NHS with 8,000 GPs and 20,000 nurses and action on health tourism; raise the personal allowance to ≥£13,000 and lift the 40% threshold to £55,000; scrap HS2, cut aid to 0.2% GNI, repeal the Climate Change Act; leave the ECHR and introduce proportional voting and citizen‑initiated referendums.",
